<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div><font face="arial">Our records indicate that you have not completed the following Graduate Diagnostic Exams:&nbsp;</font></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Music History</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Music Theory&nbsp;</span></li></ul></div><div><span style="font-family: arial;">The School of Music requires all graduate students to complete the diagnostic exams by the start of their second semester of study. A hold has been placed on your My ASU preventing you from registering for fall 2016, until the exams are completed.</span></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">The diagnostic exams are accessible online through your personal computer. Please visit this website to start the exam: <a href="http://music.asu.edu/admissions/grad/exams.php">http://music.asu.edu/admissions/grad/exams.php</a>. After you complete the exams, the hold will be removed from your My ASU account.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Julie Stephens</b></div></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" color="#999999">Coordinator, Academic Affairs + Admissions</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b><font color="#990000">Arizona State University</font>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</b></font><b style="color: rgb(255, 204, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Herberger Institute for Design and the Arts&nbsp;</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);">P.O. Box 870405 |&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);">Tempe, Arizona 85287-0405</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#999999">Phone: 480-965-5069</font></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
